Month = {FEB},
Abstract = {Embedded system design is crucial for the development of industry,
   technology, and science, and it is an area that has significantly grown
   in recent years throughout Latin America, both in academia and in
   industry. Embedded System (ES) refers to electronic equipment with a
   computing core which, unlike a personal computer, is designed to meet a
   specific function and is usually optimized to satisfy strict
   requirements of processing time, reliability, power consumption, size,
   and cost. With the advancement of research on the domains of Internet of
   Things (IoT), Computing Edge (CE) and Cloud Computing (CC) and their
   endless application possibilities, ESs have gained new roles and assumed
   unquestionable importance in our daily lives. In this article, we make a
   brief review of the relevant literature in the area of embedded systems
   in the Latin America region during recent years.},
