Abstract = {Continued improvement in computing efficiency requires functional
   specialization of hardware designs. We present an agile design flow for
   custom SoCs using the Chipyard framework, an integrated SoC research and
   implementation environment for custom systems. Chipyard includes
   configurable, composable, open-source, generator-based designs that can
   be used across multiple stages of the hardware development flow while
   maintaining design intent and integration consistency. Through cloud
   FPGA simulation and rapid ASIC implementation, we demonstrate an
   iterative agile hardware design cycle which enables continuous
   validation of physically-realizable customized systems.},
