   Processor (ASIP), which is intended for educational purposes at the
   university. ASIP allows ISA (Instruction Set Architecture) optimization
   for a specific task, which is important for project optimization.
   Considered soft processor allows step-by-step learning of ASIP
   technology and microcontroller using the Logisim simulator, as well as a
