Abstract = {With the increased adoption of IoT devices, it becomes necessary to
   detect malware before sensitive information is leaked to unfrusted
   individuals or technologies. Because of their limited computing
   resources, conventional malware detection techniques cannot be adopted
   to IoT devices. To solve this problem, we propose a malware detection
   and prevention framework that tracks information flow within the IoT
   ecosystem. The framework focuses on Android malware that compromises IoT
   user information in mobile devices as well as in the cloud.},
