   AND ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE CONFERENCE (ITAIC 2019)},
Year = {2019},
Pages = {1320-1323},
Note = {IEEE 8th Joint International Information Technology and Artificial
   Intelligence Conference (ITAIC), Chongqing, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 24-26,
   2019},
Abstract = {The complexity of embedded system has been increasing for achieving more
   intelligent work, which means more tasks need to be finished and the
   scheduling strategy based on one task character can't satisfy the cost
   of system. This paper introduces a strategy that focus on both task's
   time and value characters, and their weight in priority can be adjusted
   when the load of system changed to improve system performance. Compared
   with the performances of EDF (Earliest Deadline First), HVF (Highest
   Value First) and EDV (Earliest Deadline Value), this strategy could
   improve the system total value and the critical priority task's
   achieving rate.},
