   devices are ``small{''}, the challenge is becoming tougher. This paper
   covers full development and deployment pipeline of Face Recognition with
   a live camera - from model training and quantization to porting to
   RISC-V MCU with 512 kilobytes of internal RAM. Authors provide
   GreenWaves GAP8 SoC overview and the approaches for DNN model
   optimization and inference in the extreme environment. As the project
   outcome, authors were able to run Face Detection and Recognition with
   live QVGA camera and display preview on a battery-powered board. We will
